<title>USA: CBOT membership sells for record $857,500.</title>
<headline>CBOT membership sells for record $857,500.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the second day in a row, a full membership at the Chicago Board of Trade (CBOT) sold for a record high price, the exchange said Friday.</p>
<p>A membership sold Friday for $857,500 compared to Thursday's record of $825,001.</p>
<p>The current bid/offer for a full membership is now $790,000/$900,000, the CBOT said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
